      "writtenOn": "2026-08-13T09:43:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The increase in the overall timeout is intentional. This polling is effectively waiting for the retimer driver to become ready.\nFor retimer readiness, we depend on BIOS POST completion:\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/entity-manager/blob/master/configurations/meta/anacapa/anacapa_bridge_l.json#L56\n\nSince BIOS POST duration can vary significantly across platforms, the previous 30-second timeout was not always sufficient in our testing. Therefore, I intentionally extended the maximum wait time to 150 seconds by increasing the polling interval to 10 seconds and keeping the retry count unchanged.",
      "parentUuid": "3e516922_864b6421",
